1042
00:45:36,500 --> 00:45:39,067
- I know there's someone there.

1043
00:45:40,533 --> 00:45:42,700
- She's trying to out someone
that doesn't want to be outed.

1044
00:45:44,433 --> 00:45:46,300
- Knock once if you hear me.

1045
00:45:46,300 --> 00:45:49,800
- [Mike] Knock three times on
the ceiling if you want me.

1046
00:45:49,800 --> 00:45:52,600
- [Tom] Oh good,
they're making friends.

1047
00:45:56,100 --> 00:45:58,333
- [Mike] Battery acid?
